# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STRATOMA AI STACK — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# No Anthropic API key anywhere in this file, on purpose: the agent is
# Claude Code running on the host under your own Claude subscription
# (`claude /login`, or `claude setup-token` for a long-lived session).
# Nothing in docker-compose.yml talks to a model.
#
# That is true of the STACK. It is not true of the optional n8n workflow
# exports: 5 of the 12 call OpenRouter or Google Gemini and bill per token on
# a key you supply. They are in the checklist at the bottom of this file.

# ─── n8n ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by docker-compose.yml.
N8N_DB_PASSWORD=changeme_n8n
N8N_HOST=n8n.yourdomain.com
N8N_PROTOCOL=https
N8N_WEBHOOK_URL=https://n8n.yourdomain.com/
N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=generate_random_32chars_here
# Read by scripts/health-check.sh, and by the n8n MCP server if you wire one
# into your own Claude Code session (see README → "MCP servers").
N8N_URL=https://n8n.yourdomain.com
# Only for that MCP server. Create it in n8n: Settings → n8n API.
N8N_API_KEY=your_n8n_api_key

# ─── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by docker-compose.yml.
SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=changeme_supabase
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_min_32_chars
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_role_key
SUPABASE_URL=https://db.yourdomain.com

# ─── Optional: MCP servers for your own Claude Code session ────
# Not read by docker-compose.yml or by any script here. They exist so the
# .mcp.json you hand-write for your agent can use ${VAR} instead of a literal.
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# Quoted: the token contains a `|`, which bash would otherwise treat as a pipe,
# breaking every script that does `source .env`.
COOLIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN='1|...'
COOLIFY_BASE_URL=https://coolify.yourdomain.com

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# EXTERNAL SAAS — checklist only
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Nothing in this repo reads the variables below. They are the credentials the
# shipped n8n workflows need, and n8n stores those in its own credential vault
# (Credentials → New), not in this file. Keep them here as a checklist of what
# you must create in the n8n UI before importing the exports, or delete the
# whole block — the stack boots either way.

# ─── LLM providers used by the workflow exports (METERED) ──────
# 5 of the 12 shipped workflows will not run without these, and they bill per
# token. See n8n/workflows/README.md → "Before you import". Two of the five
# call OpenRouter over plain HTTP (replace the literal `YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY`
# inside the export); the other three use n8n credentials of type
# `openRouterApi` and `googlePalmApi`, created in the n8n UI.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# Google AI Studio key — n8n calls this credential type `googlePalmApi`
GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key

# ─── GoHighLevel (GHL) — CRM ───────────────────────────────────
# GHL > Settings > Business Profile > API Keys
GHL_API_KEY=pit-...
# Location ID: GHL > Settings > Business Info (bottom of the page)
GHL_LOCATION_ID=your_location_id
GHL_LOCATION_URL=https://app.gohighlevel.com/v2/location/your_location_id
# The WhatsApp number connected to the CRM via AppLevel (1:1 conversations)
GHL_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=+34600000000

# ─── Gmail / Google Workspace ──────────────────────────────────
# App Password: Google Account > Security > 2FA > App passwords
GMAIL_ADDRESS=comercial@yourdomain.com
# Quoted: Google app passwords contain spaces, which bash would otherwise read as
# a command name followed by arguments.
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD='xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx'
GOOGLE_WORKSPACE_DOMAIN=yourdomain.com
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-...

# ─── WhatsApp Meta API (bulk broadcasts) ───────────────────────
# Meta Business Suite > WhatsApp > API
META_WHATSAPP_TOKEN=EAA...
META_WHATSAPP_PHONE_ID=your_phone_number_id
META_WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID=your_waba_id
# Webhook verify token (you choose it)
META_WHATSAPP_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret

# ─── Evolution API (self-hosted WhatsApp, alternative to Meta) ─
EVOLUTION_API_URL=https://evolution.yourdomain.com
EVOLUTION_API_TOKEN=your_evolution_token
EVOLUTION_INSTANCE_ID=your_instance_id

# ─── Misc ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TIMEZONE is read by docker-compose.yml (n8n). SITE_URL is read by
# docker-compose.yml (Supabase Auth).
TIMEZONE=Europe/Madrid
SITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com
